{
  "dom_id": "step-4291",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Simplifying a Square Root of a Perfect Square Containing a Fraction",
  "problem": "Simplify $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{4x^2}{y^2}}.$",
  "worked_solution": "Remember that the square root of a perfect square can be simplified using absolute value.\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{x^2} = |x|\n$$\n\nAlso, we notice that $4, x^2,$ and $y^2$ are all perfect squares.\n\nFirst, we write the expression under the square root as a perfect square:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{\\frac{4{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}}} & =\\sqrt{\\frac{{2}^{2}{x}^{2}}{{y}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\cdot 2\\cdot x\\cdot x}{y\\cdot y}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{2\\cdot x\\cdot 2\\cdot x}{y\\cdot y}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{2x}{y}\\cdot \\frac{2x}{y}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{(\\frac{2x}{y})}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we take the absolute value of the squared quantity and simplify using the rules of absolute value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{{(\\frac{2x}{y})}^{2}} & =|\\frac{2x}{y}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|2x|}{|y|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|2|\\cdot |x|}{|y|} \\\\  & =\\frac{2|x|}{|y|}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-4291\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"4291\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"1355\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-4291\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-8\">Simplifying a Square Root of a Perfect Square Containing a Fraction</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"4291\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n    